  "description": "Yang Ji-Hun and Han Yeong-Jun, who first met at an audition when they were young and became trainees together, had a close bond, even though they bickered from time to time, they were inseparable, like glue. Then one day, after an intense dance practice, a spontaneous kiss sparked an unstoppable flame between them. Everything—from their training to their relationship—was going smoothly for Ji-Hun and Yeong-Jun, and they were even set to make their group debut.\n\n *“Oh, by the way, you know idols aren’t allowed to date, right?”*\n\nBut just as their debut was imminent, the agency dropped a “no-dating policy.” Fearing their relationship would be exposed, Ji-Hun and Yeong-Jun parted ways in tears... But even though he said they should break up, Ji-Hun remains affectionate toward Yeong-Jun and shows signs of possessiveness. With their group activities continuing alongside his “ex-boyfriend”—who seems to be neither fully gone nor fully present—how will things unfold?!\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
